    <item>
      <title>FreeCAD Meeting Day 2023</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-meeting-day-2023/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Jan 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/freecad-meeting-day-2023/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FPA&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FreeCAD project association (FPA)&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is organizing a meeting day in Brussels, Belgium, one day prior to &lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org/2023/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSDEM 2023&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. The event will be held at &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.ateliersdestanneurs.be/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;Atelier des Tanneurs&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, on Friday, February 3rd from 9:00 to 17:30. The event is open to anyone interested in meeting other FreeCAD developers and users and discuss about FreeCAD. No registration is required.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FOSDEM and FreeCAD Meeting travel Grants</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fosdem-and-freecad-meeting-travel-grants/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 16 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fosdem-and-freecad-meeting-travel-grants/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FPA&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FreeCAD project association (FPA)&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is offering travel grants to help FreeCAD developers and community members attend &lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org/2023/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSDEM 2023&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; in Brussels, Belgium. In addition to the official FOSDEM events on February 4th and 5th, we will be organizing a dedicated &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FPA/issues/22&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FreeCAD meeting day&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; on Friday, February 3rd. Grants are intended to help cover travel expenses and will be awarded based on the following criteria:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The FreeCAD Project Association now owns a trademark</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/the-freecad-project-association-now-owns-a-trademark/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 12 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/the-freecad-project-association-now-owns-a-trademark/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/FreeCAD/FPA&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FreeCAD Project Association&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (FPA) has registered a trademark on the FreeCAD logo! The trademark is public and can be seen &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.boip.int/en/trademarks-register?app=%2Fitem%2Fbx1466186&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;here&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
